## Follow-up Guardian Review Request
00:message/developer:<PERMISSIONS_INSTRUCTIONS>
01:message/developer:Use prior reviews as context, not binding precedent. Follow the Workspace Policy. If the user explicitly approves a previously rejected action after being informed of the concrete risks, set outcome to "allow" unless the policy explicitly disallows user overwrites in such cases.
